&lt;p&gt;KARACHI: Karachi joined other cities that have been put under Section 144 on Thursday as authorities imposed a ban on the gathering of more than five people in the city till Sept 30.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ban was notified in a Sept 24 order by Karachi Commissioner Hassan Naqvi.&lt;/p&gt;
